<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12400" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδᾰτέομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δάσομαι [ᾰ</span>], 
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δάσσομαι</span>: 
			Ep.
		
		aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δασσάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					17.50
				</span></i>
			, inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δάτταθθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
					4.29
				</span></i>
			:—<i>portion out to</i> others, <i>apportion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥμισν τῷ ἐνάρων ἀποδάσσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.231
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαιοῖς ἄλλ᾽ ἀποδάσσεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.118
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοὶ δ᾽ αὖ . . τῶνδ᾽ ἀποδάσσομαι ὅσσ᾽
					ἐπέοικεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.595
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντωνἴσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					10.86
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>part off, separate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδασάμενος μόριον ὅσον δὴ τῆς
					στρατιῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.103
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
